          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ACT.15.10"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Byak 15:10",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Kristo akatubohoorora ngu tugire obusingye; n'ahabw'ekyo mwemerere muhamire, mutagaruka mu nkomo y'obuhuuku.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GAL.5.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GAL.5.1"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GAL 5:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GAL.5.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GAL.5.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GAL 5:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Reeba, nyowe Paulo nimbagambira nti: Ku muraikirize kusharwa, Kristo naaba atakibainiire mugasho. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GAL.5.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GAL.5.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GAL 5:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ningaruka kuhamiza omuntu weena orisharwa, nti: Aine eibanja ry'okuhitsya ebiragiro byona. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GAL.5.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GAL.5.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GAL 5:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Imwe abarikwenda kwihwaho orubanja ahabw'Ebiragiro, mwecwire ahari Kristo, mwagwa mwaruga omu mbabazi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GAL.5.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GAL.5.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GAL 5:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kwonka itwe, ahabw'Omwoyo n'ahabw'okwikiriza kwaitu tutegyereize, kandi twine amatsiko g'okuheebwa okuhikiirira. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GAL.5.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GAL.5.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GAL 5:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "GAL.6.15"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Gal 6:15",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Mumanye ngu omuri Kristo Yesu okusharwa tikwine mugasho, n'obu kwakuba okutasharwa; ekiine omugasho buzima n'okwikiriza okurikukoresibwa okukunda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GAL.5.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GAL.5.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GAL 5:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ka mwabaire nimugyenda gye; n'oha owaabazibiire kworobera amazima? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GAL.5.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GAL.5.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GAL 5:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Okwohibwa oku tikurarugire ahari Ogwo owaabeetsire. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GAL.5.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GAL.5.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GAL 5:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "1CO.5.6"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "1 Kor 5:6",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Ekitumbisa kikye kitumbya ekiihuro kyona. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GAL.5.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GAL.5.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GAL 5:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nyowe nimbeesiga omuri Mukama ku mutariikiriza bindi ebitari byangye; kwonka ogwo orikubarabanisamu aryagyibwaho orubanja. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GAL.5.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GAL.5.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GAL 5:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "1CO.1.23"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "1 Kor 1:23",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Beitu B'eishe-emwe, ku ndaabe ninkibuurira eby'okusharwa, ahabw'enki ninkihiigwa? Obwo enkongi y'omusharaba neeba eihirweho. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GAL.5.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GAL.5.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GAL 5:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nkaayenzire ngu abo abarikubarabanisamu babarugyemu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GAL.5.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GAL.5.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
